  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nA folded courier rescued from
    the Lost-Property Vault. Permanent friend; remembers your letter and provides
    periodic healing.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Attack speed: +6%\nTier 1/2/3
    traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN
    THE WAITING REALM\nA courier from the folded-paper estuary, detained for taking
    a letter past the gate. The message is not their entire identity. After delivery,
    they intend to keep travelling for reasons of their own.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery
    4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing modifiers. Healing
    restrictions apply.\r\nSource: dream shop or special reward, subject to hero
    theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: hearth. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
